 make passing look better: 2 years against 4 if we both defect.\n\nI'm checking the twin's decision against the payoffs: if the twin mirrors me, passing gets 2 years against 4 for sending. I'm weighing that against the chance the twin doesn't correlate, and working out the expected values for both choices. With a high enough correlation, passing comes out ahead, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9902,"completion_tokens":601,"total_tokens":10503,"cost":0.025814,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.025814,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019804,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00601},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":321,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}